# Issue #83: the Stadium's Ultimate Match against the computer, from the map to the janken's answer. On the server
# first (a scratch server, task dev:server): an open Ultimate Match and a short wait for the computer,
#   yo3-server create-event --data-dir DATA ultimate "Ultimate Test" --end +6h
#   yo3-server set --data-dir DATA ultimate-cpu-wait 3
# The result is random: a draw also says "A draw: pick rock, paper or scissors again." in the chat window (#83), and
# the scene asks for another hand (pick again by hand, or rerun from a fresh login).
click 505 275                    # the map's Stadium (DUELKING TITLEMATCH)
expect component OfficialEvent 15
sleep 3
click 380 151                    # the first event: ULTIMATE MATCH
sleep 2
click 636 437                    # Ready
expect component HolderSelect 20  # the computer was found after the wait: Select Deck
sleep 2
click 393 533                    # Select Deck's OK
expect flash "Janken.beginJanken" 20
sleep 1
click 350 470                    # rock
expect flash "Janken.resolveJanken" 10
shot stadium-janken
